**Brand identity:** AURELION  
**Hero product:** AURELION ONE — a fictional next-generation luxury audio device featuring precision-machined titanium, sculptural geometry, smoked glass, ceramic surfaces, and subtle luminous accents.

Keep the product branding, price, product specifications, colors, and descriptive content centralized so they can be changed easily.

