- A view-angle control or interactive drag rotation
- A reset-view button
- An animated selected-state indicator
- A product summary
- A clearly displayed price

Make each option visibly and functionally update the rendered scene or the selected configuration.

If the actual model cannot support every possible customization, implement the available options honestly using supported geometry, materials, and product presets.

Persist the selected configuration while navigating between pages.

Include touch-friendly controls and keyboard support.

