- Weight
- Acoustic or performance specifications appropriate to the fictional device
- Battery or power information where relevant
- Compatibility

Use clearly labeled, fictional concept specifications, not fabricated claims about a real product.

Reveal technical specifications progressively using scroll animation, fine grid lines, animated markers, and restrained interface transitions.

#### Section G: Final conversion section

Create a cinematic closing scene with the product hero returning into view.

Headline:

“YOUR WORLD.
IN PERFECT DETAIL.”

Display the configured product summary and selected finish.

Provide:
