The final result must satisfy all of the following:

- The React application starts successfully.
- Production compilation succeeds.
- Every requested route loads and refreshes correctly.
- The hero contains a functioning interactive 3D product or an explicitly implemented procedural alternative.
- Scroll animation is driven by GSAP ScrollTrigger.
- Smooth scrolling works without breaking navigation or accessibility.
- The custom cursor works on supported desktop devices.
- Magnetic buttons are bounded and interactive.
- Shader effects actually respond to interaction.
- Page transitions function for click navigation and browser history.
- Product options visibly change product state.
- Cart operations and totals work correctly.
- Layout adapts to small and large screens.
- Reduced-motion and WebGL fallback behavior work.
- No important button is decorative or inert.
- No fake payment or unsupported functionality is presented as real.
- No placeholder content, broken image, missing model, or uncaught runtime error blocks the intended experience.

